# KANANA 1.5 8B Instruct (2505) — 직접 변환한 Q4_K_M GGUF
# 템플릿은 원본 tokenizer_config.json의 chat_template({# version=v3-llama3.1 #})을 Go 템플릿으로 옮긴 것.
#   - 시스템 블록은 항상 맨 앞에 하나 있고, 도구가 있으면 도구 설명과 호출 형식 안내가 여기에 들어간다.
#   - 도구 호출 출력 형식: <function=이름>{JSON 인자}</function>, 끝은 <|eom_id|>
#   - 도구 결과는 ipython 역할로 돌려준다.
FROM ../models/kanana-1.5-8b-Q4_K_M.gguf

TEMPLATE """<|start_header_id|>system<|end_header_id|>


{{ if .Tools }}
You have access to the following functions:

{{ range .Tools }}Use the function '{{ .Function.Name }}' to '{{ .Function.Description }}'
{{ .Function }}

{{ end }}
Think very carefully before calling functions.
If a you choose to call a function ONLY reply in the following format:
<{start_tag}={function_name}>{parameters}{end_tag}
where

start_tag => `<function`
parameters => a JSON dict with the function argument name as key and function argument value as value.
end_tag => `</function>`

Here is an example,
<function=example_function_name>{"example_name": "example_value"}</function>

Reminder:
- If looking for real time information use relevant functions before falling back to brave_search
- Function calls MUST follow the specified format, start with <function= and end with </function>
- Required parameters MUST be specified
- Only call one function at a time
- Put the entire function call reply on one line

{{ end }}<|eot_id|>
{{- range .Messages }}
{{- if or (eq .Role "user") (eq .Role "system") }}<|start_header_id|>{{ .Role }}<|end_header_id|>

{{ .Content }}<|eot_id|>
{{- else if eq .Role "tool" }}<|start_header_id|>ipython<|end_header_id|>

{{ .Content }}<|eot_id|>
{{- else if eq .Role "assistant" }}
{{- if or .Content .ToolCalls }}<|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>

{{ end }}
{{- if .Content }}{{ .Content }}{{ end }}
{{- if .ToolCalls }}{{ range .ToolCalls }}<function={{ .Function.Name }}>{{ .Function.Arguments }}</function>{{ end }}<|eom_id|>
{{- else if .Content }}<|eot_id|>
{{- end }}
{{- end }}
{{- end }}<|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>

"""

PARAMETER stop "<|eot_id|>"
PARAMETER stop "<|eom_id|>"
PARAMETER stop "<|start_header_id|>"
PARAMETER num_ctx 16384
PARAMETER temperature 0.2
